    "title": "Community support needed for Pasadena High's mariachi program to provide instruments. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Pasadena High School is building a new mariachi program and needs your help. We’re raising funds to purchase the instruments, equipment, and supplies our students need to learn and perform mariachi music. Right now, not every student has access to their own instrument, and that shouldn’t stand in the way of joining this program. Read full article",
